OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is there a memorial for German
OL,4,Asoldiers at an Essex bus stop?
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to a bus stop in rural Essex
OL,7,Fmay have looked over their shoulders
OL,8,Fand wondered what the small, grey
OL,9,Fgravestone was.
OL,11,FThe masonry greets people at Greens
OL,12,FFarm Lane in Billericay using the
OL,13,Fnumber nine for Brentwood or the 251 to
OL,14,FWarley.
OL,16,FLook closer, and you will see a picture
OL,17,Fof a Zeppelin airship along with a
OL,18,Fmention of 22 German soldiers who lost
OL,19,Ftheir lives on 24 September 1916,
OL,20,Fduring World War One.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
